
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Order Booked Successfully</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            background: #f5f7fa;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        .success-container {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 25px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 20px;
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 420px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
            animation: fadeIn 0.6s ease;
        }

        .success-circle {
            width: 110px;
            height: 110px;
            background: #22c55e;
            border-radius: 50%;
            margin: 0 auto 25px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            animation: circlePop 0.5s ease;
        }

        .checkmark {
            width: 35px;
            height: 60px;
            border-right: 7px solid white;
            border-bottom: 7px solid white;
            transform: rotate(45deg) scale(0);
            animation: drawCheck 0.4s ease 0.5s forwards;
        }

        h1 {
            color: #16a34a;
            font-size: 27px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        p {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .success-line {
            width: 60px;
            height: 4px;
            background: #22c55e;
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            animation: lineGrow 0.7s ease;
        }

        .home-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 13px 28px;
            background: #16a34a;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .home-btn:hover {
            background: #15803d;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        @keyframes circlePop {
            0% { transform: scale(0); }
            70% { transform: scale(1.15); }
            100% { transform: scale(1); }
        }

        @keyframes drawCheck {
            to {
                transform: rotate(45deg) scale(1);
            }
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        @keyframes lineGrow {
            from { width: 0; }
            to { width: 60px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="success-container">

        <div class="success-circle">
            <div class="checkmark"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="success-line"></div>

        <h1>Order Booked!</h1>

        <p>
            Your order has been successfully placed.
            Thank you for shopping with us!
        </p>

        <a href="/" class="home-btn">
            Continue Shopping
        </a>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
